OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #170k awarded to improve
OL,4,Alocal facilities
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity venues and public spaces
OL,7,Facross a Surrey borough are to benefit
OL,8,Ffrom grants aimed at improving local
OL,9,Ffacilities.
OL,11,FSurrey Heath Borough Council said that
OL,12,Fthe funding was from the latest call
OL,13,Ffor the Community Infrastructure Levy
OL,14,F(CIL) funds, where more #170,000 have
OL,15,Fbeen awarded.
OL,17,FUpgrades include new play equipment,
OL,18,Fenhancements to community venues,
OL,19,Faccessibility improvements, solar
OL,20,Fpanels and CCTV cameras.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
